<div id="A2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The dataset statistics of all datasets used in the main paper are given in Table <a href="#A2.T6" title="Table 6 ‣ Appendix B Extended Results ‣ Walking Out of the Weisfeiler Leman Hierarchy: Graph Learning Beyond Message Passing" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a>.
In the following, we provide experimental results in full detail.</p>
</div>
<section id="A2.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">B.1 </span>Detailed Results</h3>

<figure id="A2.T7" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 7: </span>Extended results for <span id="A2.T7.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">CRaWl</span> on all datasets. Note that different metrics are used to measure the performance on the datasets. For each experiment we provide the cross model deviation (CMD) and the internal model deviation (IMD).</figcaption>
